# The fast tier of goal.scenario, for iterating: the same world and the same
# 32 days on 192x192 (0.56 of the area, ~1.6x faster). Its kill lines are the
# full goal's scaled by the area: by the full goal's rule its own baseline
# would ask 32 and 39, set by one seed whose foxes eat the flock out (notes.md).
# The floors are its 16-day ones (half its usual lowest hens; 3 foxes x 0.56).
# It is harsher than the full goal (fewer founders); goal.scenario decides.
rules ../../rules
seed 42
seeds 8
pass 7
size 192 192
terrain water_scale 12 water_level 0.30 rock_on_soil 0.04 rock_on_water 0.01
start chicken 1 / 400
start fox     1 / 5000
start flower  1 / 250
start hive    1 / 20000
start grass   1 / 20
start seed    1 / 100

run 32d
expect mean eaten chicken by fox per day >= 21 from 2d   # the full goal's 37 x 0.56 (its baseline: 9.1 .. 31.5, median 15.9)
expect mean eaten chicken by fox per day >= 23 from 9d   # the full goal's 40 x 0.56 (7.3 .. 38.2, median 15.8)
expect always count chicken >= 60 from 2d                # half its 16-day usual lowest (122); its baseline: 0 .. 41
expect always count fox >= 2 from 2d                     # its baseline: 0 .. 1
